    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide estimates of population counts by age and sex for the year 2010, consistent with national censuses and population registers, as raster data to facilitate data integration.",
    "ciesin:supplemental_info": "The documentation for this data set is available at http://sedac.ciesin.columbia.edu/data/set/gpw-v4-basic-demographic-characteristics-rev11/docs.",
